\frac{\mathrm{E}_1}{\mathrm{E}_2}=\frac{\mathrm{T}_1^4-\mathrm{T}_0^4}{\mathrm{~T}_2^4-\mathrm{T}_0^4}=\frac{(600)^4-(300)^4}{(700)^4-(300)^4}=\frac{6^4-3^4}{7^4-3^4}

